# =============================================================================
# Complete Agentic AI Bootcamp — LangGraph & LangChain
# =============================================================================
# Scope: Python 3.14 / uv project covering LangChain (ingestion, embeddings,
# vector stores), LangGraph (stateful agents, memory, multi-agent workflows),
# RAG agents, autonomous research assistants, and deployable agent apps.
#
# Not ignored on purpose (must stay tracked):
#   - uv.lock, pyproject.toml, .python-version, requirements.txt
#   - *.ipynb notebooks and the sample data in each 00_data/ folder
#   - .env.example (template for required API keys)
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & credentials
# API keys: OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, Google, HuggingFace, Pinecone, Tavily,
# SerpAPI, LangSmith (LANGCHAIN_API_KEY / LANGSMITH_API_KEY)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
token.json
service-account*.json
.streamlit/secrets.toml


